@startuml Delegation
title Delegated Token Exchange (No Impersonation)

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
}

participant "Alice\n(Delegate)" as Alice
participant "Delegation Service\n(Service Account)" as DS
participant "Keycloak\nwith Custom Token Exchange Endpoint" as KC
participant "Resource Server / API" as RS

== Step 1: Alice authenticates ==
Alice -> KC : Authorization Code / Client Auth
KC --> Alice : Access Token\n(sub = Alice)

== Step 2: Alice requests delegated access ==
Alice -> DS : Request delegation token\nfor Joe\n(scope, expiry)

== Step 3: Delegation Service performs token exchange ==
DS -> KC : POST /token\n\
grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange\n\
subject_token = Alice_token\n\
delegation_id = <uuid>\n\
delegator_sub = Joe

== Step 4: Keycloak mints delegated token ==
KC --> DS : Access Token\n\
sub = Alice\n\
delegation = {\n\
  delegator_sub: Joe,\n\
  scopes,\n\
  expires_at\n\
}

== Step 5: Delegated token is returned ==
DS --> Alice : Delegated Access Token

== Step 6: Resource access ==
Alice -> RS : API call\nAuthorization: Bearer delegated_token
RS --> Alice : Authorized response\n(acting for Joe)

@enduml